              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otaligilira kwo otyo Omukama Ruhanga wawe, aha rw'okuba buli kintu ekibi eky'Omukama anoba nikyo bakoleraga baruhanga bago. Kuba abana babo babatambira baruhanga babo ebihongo by'okwokibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
